
== report inside its own watch
error: the report would be one of the files it watches, so every report would wake it again; keep the report outside reports/*
exit=1

== watch * with the report in a matched folder
error: the report would land in a folder it watches, so every report would wake it again; keep the report outside *
exit=1

== report escaping the workspace
error: a report path must stay inside the item's workspace
exit=1

== report as an absolute path elsewhere
error: a report path is relative to the item's workspace
exit=1

